# DCLA root search ignore  —  install as:  <DCLA-root>/.ignore
#
# Purpose: keep broad tools (ripgrep, fd, and anything honouring .ignore) out of
# generated, vendored, and cache trees. This is the single largest reduction in
# routine context cost, because the tax comes from enumeration, not from bytes
# sitting on disk.
#
# DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED — these can be authoritative research inputs,
# tracked website output, or operational handoffs:
#   *.zip  *.csv  *.pdf  *.ndjson (except *.inspect.ndjson)  dist/ under
#   published sites  .claude/ generally
# Use `rg --no-ignore` for intentional forensic searches.

# --- dependency + virtualenv trees -----------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.tox/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/

# --- VCS internals ----------------------------------------------------------
**/.git/

# --- build output / framework caches ---------------------------------------
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/.vercel/
**/.turbo/
**/.parcel-cache/

# --- tooling caches ---------------------------------------------------------
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/coverage/
**/.cache/

# --- minified / generated artefacts ----------------------------------------
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css
**/*.map

# --- OS noise ---------------------------------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# --- project-specific -------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable inspection dumps (~436 MiB when present). If these are ever
# needed for a real search, use --no-ignore; final workbooks/reports/previews
# are the canonical artefacts.
**/*.inspect.ndjson

# Archived research diary: preserved in full under history/, but must never be
# swept into a broad search. See CLAUDE.md router.
**/history/research-log-B1232-B1457/

# NOTE: site-mockups/.claude/worktrees/ is INTENTIONALLY OMITTED here.
# Adding it while the website Git/worktree resolution is still in flight would
# hide live state from the session doing that work. Add this line only after
# that work has landed:
# site-mockups/.claude/worktrees/
